{"id":467,"name":"magmortar","speciesId":467,"dex":467,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["fire"],"stats":{"hp":75,"attack":95,"defense":67,"special-attack":125,"special-defense":95,"speed":83},"abilities":[{"name":"flame-body","hidden":false},{"name":"vital-spirit","hidden":true}],"height":16,"weight":680,"baseExp":243,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/467.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/467.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/467.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/467.ogg","genus":"Blast Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Explosivo","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees F from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters."},{"version":"platinum","text":"When launching 3,600 degrees F fireballs, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit out of its arms. Its breath also sears and sizzles."},{"version":"black-2","text":"When shooting 3,600 degree F fireballs from its arms, its body takes on a whitish hue from the intense heat."},{"version":"x","text":"It blasts fireballs of over 3,600 degrees Fahrenheit from the ends of its arms. It lives in volcanic craters."},{"version":"sun","text":"They dwell in volcanic craters. According to what is known, a single pair of male and female Magmortar lives in one volcano."},{"version":"moon","text":"From its arm, it launches fireballs hotter than 3,500 degrees Fahrenheit. Its arm starts to melt when it fires a whole barrage."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"There are still quite a few factories that rely on the flames provided by Magmortar to process metals."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"Magmortar takes down its enemies